      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* L1 (compute-node memory):\n- hotest result, small aggregates, dictionaries, metadata, recently accessed\nblocks\n- ~microms latency\n- capacity is limit, use LFU or LRU eviction\n\n* L2 (local SSD)\n- medium/large intermediate results, hot historical partitions, results too large\nfor RAM, compressed columnar blocks\n\n\n* L3\n- expensive intermediate materialization, cross-node reuse, expensive query\nresults, preventing fleet-wide recomputation\n(Eg: Redis, Memcached, Alluxio, distributed KV, object cache)\n- avoid putting multi-GB analytical results in Redis.\n- Use Redis for cache metadata + pointer, Blob/cache layer for actually large\nresults\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* L1 (compute-node memory):\n- hotest result, small aggregates, dictionaries, metadata, recently accessed blocks\n- ~microms latency\n- capacity is limit, use LFU or LRU eviction\n\n* L2 (local SSD)\n- medium/large intermediate results, hot historical partitions, results too large for RAM, compressed columnar blocks\n\n\n* L3\n- expensive intermediate materialization, cross-node reuse, expensive query results, preventing fleet-wide recomputation\n(Eg: Redis, Memcached, Alluxio, distributed KV, object cache)\n- avoid putting multi-GB analytical results in Redis.\n- Use Redis for cache metadata + pointer, Blob/cache layer for actually large results\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
